<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH BREWER PRAZDROJ POSTS LOWER '96 NET.</title>
<headline>CZECH BREWER PRAZDROJ POSTS LOWER '96 NET.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Plzen-based Czech brewer Plzensky Prazdroj a.s. said on Wednesday its audited 1996 results showed a net profit of 74.9 million crowns, down from 158.1 million crowns a year earlier.</p>
<p>&quot;The size of the profit was influenced by the investment into construction which last year totalled about 1.2 billion crowns,&quot; Prazdroj spokesman Jaroslav Pomp told Reuters.</p>
</text>
